# Track H — AMD Metal 31001 wire proposal (stage only)

**Do not apply to live** `amd_vega.py` / `amd_polaris.py` / `amd_legacy_gcn.py`
without Mission Control merge.

## Snippet (after `compositor_patches` import)

```python
from ...shared_patches.tahoe_iosurface_ca import iosurface_ca_patches
```

## Snippet (inside `patches()` return / `_base.update`)

```python
**iosurface_ca_patches(self._xnu_major, self._xnu_minor, self._constants.detected_os_version),
```

## Env

| Variable | Effect |
|----------|--------|
| (unset) | no-op (Metal stock IOSurface/CA) |
| `X86_EXTREME=1` | status only — still no MERGE |
| `X86_EXTREME=1` + `X86_EXTREME_IOSURFACE_CA=1` | Non-Metal IOSurface.framework+kext and QuartzCore MERGE if PSP present |

No permanent blocked gate in Track H. Promote `tahoe_iosurface_ca.py.stage-H` first.
